# The apps' images read this checkout as the build context "hiroleague" (the UI kit, the SDK, the kits, the build
# kit). What a check or an install writes here stays out: the core's deploy rewrites ui-kit/node_modules and
# ui-kit/.svelte-kit at every run, and a copied UI kit that looks new makes every app's npm ci run again (14 of 14
# app deploys with a core deploy reinstalled their packages). The apps take only the kit's sources and
# scripts/kit-sync.mjs, which uses Node's own modules.
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
